  "label": "User projected onto the man in the image as the subject of the derogatory label",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the man (VisualMaterial entity) who is depicted as the '40sec man' mentioned in the top text. The meme uses the man's image as a stand-in for 'you' in the phrase 'when she calls you a 40sec man', creating a direct identification with the viewer. The user is also implicitly projected onto the scenario described in the bottom text ('but she paid own bride price to marry you'), which frames the man's perceived inadequacy as being compensated for by the woman's financial contribution, thus making the user feel personally implicated in this transactional dynamic.",
